					<description><![CDATA[#JazzHiveSession #NeuköllnLive #DonnerstagsLive Heute ab 19 Uhr geöffnet. 21 Uhr geht´s los!Kleine Perlen der Großstadt in einer besonderen Nacht live in Neukölln! I look very excited forward to play with Mike Segal, Daigo Nakai and Shinichi Nakajima next Thursday Jan. 29th 2026 at Little Stage!https://www.marafioti-jazz-berlin.de/&#8230;/jazz-concert&#8230;/ https://www.facebook.com/antonello.marafioti/posts/pfbid02QsqTASLhwiYspBEYarHxoZ2522t1ZxFRcnr3gr18mbWwLnQnhH44vf1zDfoRS6VNl?__cft__[0]=AZZGbzWWduPpEKkIKeJ0DPYEaJbShNlDtdXLnHu4LlDggMERLwBRro91kQYUyJmAH1QhFNlH9mP5L4p8VTbTPLi7uabUfZX6jVP7jY1NL8M1JPxh0dWBPNyrTXw4zgjh0FYOIB5ANImsRBz7cIZVNt5kbhCf6fob0WXO7uGJgjQD0MTONfr7uCIueCZJlf_eH_E&#38;__tn__=-UK-R]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">#JazzHiveSession #NeuköllnLive #DonnerstagsLive</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Heute ab 19 Uhr geöffnet. 21 Uhr geht´s los!<br />Kleine Perlen der Großstadt in einer besonderen Nacht live in Neukölln!</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I look very excited forward to play with Mike Segal, Daigo Nakai and Shinichi Nakajima next Thursday Jan. 29th 2026 at Little Stage!<br /><a href="https://www.marafioti-jazz-berlin.de/event/jazz-concert-presentation-of-the-first-album-of-antonello-marafioti-blues-on/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAc3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHsMS-EqbeUmcRuJ8K3EC_WLy9SifneHOVIezw7oicifSZCoSU6THYmSVqVUp_aem_1Mft9FD1kG6bCcbZFRkC2Q" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.marafioti-jazz-berlin.de/&#8230;/jazz-concert&#8230;/</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><img data-attachment-id="2348" data-permalink="https://littlestageclubneukoelln.wordpress.com/2026/01/29/kleine-perlen-der-grosstadt/617135715_1207310101538078_1299963521460228718_n/" data-orig-file="https://littlestageclubneukoelln.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/617135715_1207310101538078_1299963521460228718_n.jpg" data-orig-size="848,848" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-title="617135715_1207310101538078_1299963521460228718_n" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://littlestageclubneukoelln.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/617135715_1207310101538078_1299963521460228718_n.jpg?w=663" class="wp-image-2348" style="width: 150px" src="https://littlestageclubneukoelln.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/617135715_1207310101538078_1299963521460228718_n.jpg" alt=""/><br /><a href="https://www.facebook.com/antonello.marafioti/posts/pfbid02QsqTASLhwiYspBEYarHxoZ2522t1ZxFRcnr3gr18mbWwLnQnhH44vf1zDfoRS6VNl?__cft__[0]=AZZGbzWWduPpEKkIKeJ0DPYEaJbShNlDtdXLnHu4LlDggMERLwBRro91kQYUyJmAH1QhFNlH9mP5L4p8VTbTPLi7uabUfZX6jVP7jY1NL8M1JPxh0dWBPNyrTXw4zgjh0FYOIB5ANImsRBz7cIZVNt5kbhCf6fob0WXO7uGJgjQD0MTONfr7uCIueCZJlf_eH_E&amp;__tn__=-UK-R">https://www.facebook.com/antonello.marafioti/posts/pfbid02QsqTASLhwiYspBEYarHxoZ2522t1ZxFRcnr3gr18mbWwLnQnhH44vf1zDfoRS6VNl?__cft__[0]=AZZGbzWWduPpEKkIKeJ0DPYEaJbShNlDtdXLnHu4LlDggMERLwBRro91kQYUyJmAH1QhFNlH9mP5L4p8VTbTPLi7uabUfZX6jVP7jY1NL8M1JPxh0dWBPNyrTXw4zgjh0FYOIB5ANImsRBz7cIZVNt5kbhCf6fob0WXO7uGJgjQD0MTONfr7uCIueCZJlf_eH_E&amp;__tn__=-UK-R</a></p>
